<title>USA: Meridian Diagnostics test gets German okay.</title>
<headline>Meridian Diagnostics test gets German okay.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meridian Diagnostics Inc said on Wednesday its diagnostic test for rotavirus, Premier Rotaclone, has received approval from the Paul-Ehrlich- Institut, Germany's regulatory body.</p>
<p>Rotavirus is a virus that infects the lining of the stomach and intestine.</p>
